        "original_id": "f984037a-9b5e-5354-ae48-029de69f2f69",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: \"The Clash of Triton\", \"Neptune's Party\", \"SpongeBob's Truth or Square\", \"To SquarePants or Not to SquarePants\", \"SpongeBob SquarePants\"\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n- Topics: episode numbering, season 6 broadcasts\n\nFacts:\n- \"The Clash of Triton\", also known as \"Neptune's Party\", is the 26th episode of season 6 and the 126th overall episode of the American animated television series \"SpongeBob SquarePants\".\n- \"The Clash of Triton\" originally aired on Nickelodeon in the United States on July 5, 2010.\n- The television film \"SpongeBob's Truth or Square\" and the special episode \"To SquarePants or Not to SquarePants\" were broadcast on Nickelodeon as part of the celebration.",
